  const MSTEPS=[["listen", "Listen", "Understand you first", "An unhurried consultation about your goals, history, lifestyle and what you've already tried. You set the priorities; we ask detailed questions about your health."], ["measure", "Measure", "Find the baseline", "The right assessments for your goal, never a one-size panel. We measure before we treat, so every decision has a reason and every result has a starting point."], ["plan", "Plan", "One written plan", "Your treatments, their order, the timeline and the cost, in writing. Aesthetic, regenerative, hormonal and Naturopathic Care combined only where it helps."], ["treat", "Treat", "The right hands", "Each treatment is provided by a clinician trained and authorised to perform it: a Naturopathic Doctor, our MD, our Nurse Practitioner or our nutritionist, working from the same plan."], ["support", "Support", "Build the foundations", "Nutrition, sleep, stress, movement and targeted supplements, plus home care. The everyday foundations that support your treatment plan."], ["refine", "Track & Refine", "Re-measure and adjust", "We re-check the same measures on a schedule, review them with you, and adjust. Your numbers and photos live in your patient dashboard."]],MAPPLY={"aesthetics": ["What bothers you, how you want to look, and your skin, hormone and health history.", "Standardized photos and skin assessment; labs when thinning hair, dull skin or acne suggest an internal cause.", "Injectables, regenerative skin and skincare sequenced over months, with a clear budget.", "Precise, conservative injections and treatments by trained practitioners.", "Medical-grade home care, sun protection, nutrition for skin, collagen support.", "Follow-up photos at set intervals, with any further treatment planned at review."], "pain": ["Where it hurts, when it started, what makes it worse, and what you want to get back to.", "Movement and function testing and diagnostic ultrasound; imaging reviewed when needed.", "Regenerative injections chosen for the tissue involved, with a realistic recovery timeline.", "Ultrasound-guided injections placed exactly where they're needed.", "Rehab exercises, red light and recovery therapies, anti-inflammatory nutrition.", "Pain and function scores re-checked; plans stepped up or down based on progress."], "hormones-weight": ["Symptoms, cycle and life stage, weight history, and the approaches you've tried.", "Comprehensive hormone panels, HOMA-IR, and a Styku or DEXA Body Composition baseline.", "BHRT, Testosterone or GLP-1 support only when testing supports it, with safety checks built in.", "Prescribing and monitoring by our Naturopathic Doctors, MD and Nurse Practitioner.", "Protein and nutrition targets, strength training guidance, sleep and stress support.", "Labs and Body Composition re-tested every few months; doses adjusted, muscle protected."], "longevity": ["What healthy aging means to you, family history, energy, sleep and fitness.", "VO2 max, arterial stiffness, advanced blood work and, if useful, totalPower DNA Test.", "A prioritized plan for your biggest risks, from cellular therapies to training zones.", "IV and cellular therapies, recovery and performance sessions in clinic.", "Training, nutrition and sleep habits matched to your results.", "Annual re-testing of your key markers, so you can see how you're aging over time."], "labs": ["The question behind the test: what you want to know and why.", "The right panel for that question, from routine LifeLabs work to advanced functional tests.", "Clear preparation instructions and a follow-up already booked when you test.", "Samples collected efficiently, in clinic or at a partner lab.", "A doctor walks you through every result, in plain language, with clinician-set targets.", "Results stored in your dashboard and re-tested on a schedule to track trends."], "naturopathic": ["Your whole story: symptoms, history, diet, sleep, stress and environment.", "Targeted functional and conventional testing when it will change the plan.", "A root-cause plan, usually starting with the simplest, most effective changes.", "Naturopathic treatments, IV Therapy, nutrition and immunotherapy as needed.", "Coaching and check-ins that make changes stick, with only the supplements you need.", "Symptoms and markers reviewed at each visit; plans simplified as you improve."]},MTABS=[["aesthetics", "Aesthetics"], ["pain", "Pain & Regenerative"], ["hormones-weight", "Hormones & Weight"], ["longevity", "Performance & Longevity"], ["labs", "Testing"], ["naturopathic", "Naturopathic & General Health"]],MPRINC=[["Look for <em>contributing factors.</em>", "Every plan starts with a consultation, so factors such as hormones, metabolism, nutrition and inflammation can be considered."], ["Measured, <em>not guessed.</em>", "Decisions are based on your assessments and numbers, and we re-test so you can see what's changing."], ["One team, <em>one plan.</em>", "Naturopathic Doctors, a Medical Doctor, a Nurse Practitioner and a nutritionist share one plan, so you never have to repeat your story."], ["Least invasive <em>first.</em>", "We start with the simplest appropriate option and add more only when it is needed."], ["Honest and <em>unhurried.</em>", "Clear costs, realistic timelines and no pressure. If you don't need a treatment, we'll tell you. Trust comes first."]],MTEAM=[["Dr. Navi Badesha", "ND", "Founder & lead Naturopathic Doctor", "Dr. Navi Badesha founded Mediworks and has practised as a Naturopathic Doctor since 2005. His work centres on practical, integrative care that helps patients feel and function better day to day. A lifelong interest in sport and fitness led him into longevity, recovery, pain management and aesthetic medicine. He is certified in IV and chelation therapy, cosmetic and therapeutic neuromodulator injections, PRP, PRF and prolotherapy, and holds prescriptive authority. He aims to bring honesty, compassion and respect to every visit."], ["Dr. Annthonet Bernales", "ND", "Naturopathic Doctor", "Dr. Annthonet Bernales earned a BSc in Biological Sciences at Simon Fraser University and her Doctor of Naturopathic Medicine at the Boucher Institute of Naturopathic Medicine in 2017. She sees patients of all ages and combines evidence-informed natural medicine with practical lifestyle strategies, with a focus on prevention and long-term wellness. Her areas include IV nutrient therapy, women's Hormone Therapy, Weight Loss, longevity, aesthetic PRP, neuromodulator injections and sublingual immunotherapy, and she holds prescriptive authority. Outside the clinic, she spends her time with family."], ["Dr. Guntaas Gill", "ND", "Naturopathic Doctor", "Dr. Guntaas Gill is a licensed Naturopathic Doctor in British Columbia who provides evidence-informed, integrative care. Dr. Gill focuses on energy, metabolic health, Weight Loss, hormone balance and the root causes of fatigue, and builds personalised plans that fit into everyday life. Clinical interests include IV therapy, women's health and aesthetic medicine, including aesthetic PRP, and Dr. Gill holds prescriptive authority. Outside the clinic, Dr. Gill enjoys staying active, time with family and travel."], ["Dr. Ray Lendvai", "ND", "Naturopathic Doctor", "Dr. Ray Lendvai graduated from the Canadian College of Naturopathic Medicine in 1991, and in 1995 completed a six-month internship at the National Institute of Homoeopathy in Kolkata, India. His practice draws on naturopathic, botanical and homeopathic medicine, Traditional Chinese Medicine and acupuncture, and nutrition and lifestyle counselling, for both men's and women's health. He is certified in chelation therapy, IV vitamin C, B12 injections and injections for pain and inflammation."], ["Dr. Jay Gunaratnarajah", "ND", "Naturopathic Doctor", "Dr. Janaparan (Jay) Gunaratnarajah trained at the Canadian College of Naturopathic Medicine in Toronto, with an internship at Brampton Civic Hospital, and holds a Master's in Public Health. With more than seven years in clinical practice, he takes an evidence-based, integrative approach to metabolic health, longevity and cellular and mitochondrial function. He works with weight changes, fatigue, thyroid concerns, low Testosterone, Fertility Health for men and other hormone and metabolic conditions. His interests include IV and chelation therapy, ozone, Bioidentical Hormone Therapy, acupuncture and regenerative approaches to pain."], ["Dr. Birpal Pannu", "MD", "Medical Doctor", "Dr. Birpal Pannu is a family physician certified by the College of Family Physicians of Canada (CCFP) and board certified by the American Board of Family Medicine. He completed his Family Medicine residency at the University of North Dakota School of Medicine, where he served as Chief Resident, and is an elected member of the Alpha Omega Alpha Honor Society. His special interest is men's health and hormone management, including assessing and treating low Testosterone, and he leads virtual Initial Consultations in the Mediworks TRT protocol."], ["Stephen Martin", "NP", "Nurse Practitioner"], ["Joyce Hoffmann", "RHN", "Registered Holistic Nutritionist"], ["Kamal Badesha", "RPN", "Registered Psychiatric Nurse", ""]];
